    "northStar": "Reference-led portfolio recreation",
    "overview": "Matthew Suwiryo's portfolio retains the reference blue atmosphere, soft blossom-pink biconcave cells, Graphik identity, and expanding charcoal menu. Confirmed content now describes a senior at DVHS, class of 2027, pursuing biology/pre-med with the goal of becoming a doctor. Contact links come from src/profile.js; custom tagline messages are preserved. Experiments and Writing are coming-soon pages, including legacy aliases.",
